Maintainer: Benn Banks <me@bennbanks.com>
Description: GoGitOps agent mesh daemon
 GoGitOps is a decentralized agent mesh for homelab fleet management.
 It runs a health checker daemon that reports node status, runs recipes,
 and peers with other gogitops nodes. No external dependencies required.
 .
 Optional integrations:
  - Discord alerts via direct webhook URL
  - NetEnv for secrets distribution (install gogitops-netenv separately)
